---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Get to know Jaime Molina"
	pubDate={new Date('May 17 2026')}
>
	<style is:inline>
		.date { display: none !important; }
	</style>
	<div class="hero-image">
		<img src="/profile.jpg" alt="Jaime Molina" style="display: block; margin: 0 auto 2em auto; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: var(--box-shadow); max-width: 100%;" />
	</div>
	<p>
		I define myself as an open and sociable person with a technical profile and a strong capacity for work, communication, and organization. My experience in multicultural teams in the Netherlands, along with my stays in France (5 months) and Canada (2 months), has allowed me to develop a strong capacity for teamwork, mediation, and conflict resolution.
	</p>

	<p>
		I am decisive when facing the unexpected and enjoy organizing workflows that maximize group efficiency. This adaptability allows me to approach technical challenges from a logical, creative, and resilient perspective.
	</p>

	<p>
		Beyond engineering and programming, I am a very active person and a sports enthusiast. I love training, whether it is going for a run, practicing calisthenics, climbing, or occasionally hitting the gym (I also have a background in athletics!). This dedication to sports keeps me disciplined and energized in my day-to-day life.
	</p>

	<div class="panel">
		<h3>Languages</h3>
		<ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;">
			<li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">🇪🇸 <strong>Spanish:</strong> Native or Bilingual</li>
			<li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">🇫🇷 <strong>French:</strong> Native or Bilingual</li>
			<li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">🇬🇧 <strong>English:</strong> Native or Bilingual</li>
			<li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">🇳🇱 <strong>Dutch:</strong> Elementary</li>
			<li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">🇩🇪 <strong>German:</strong> Elementary</li>
		</ul>
	</div>

	<div class="panel">
		<h3>Contact</h3>
		<p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
			If you believe my profile would be a great fit for your team, I would love to work together!
		</p>
		<ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;">
			<li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:jaime.molina.tcs@gmail.com">jaime.molina.tcs@gmail.com</a></li>
			<li><strong>LinkedIn:</strong> <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jaime-molina-garcía-0b75b73a8" target="_blank">Jaime Molina García</a></li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</Layout>
